<title>EU: EU beef intervention purchases down.</title>
<headline>EU beef intervention purchases down.</headline>
<dateline>REUTER 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 13,519 tonnes of beef was accepted into intervention by the European Union's beef management committee on Friday, a Commission official said.</p>
<p>The tenders were subject to a maximum price of 273 ecus per 100 kg.</p>
<p>&quot;The amount of beef bought into intervention is continuing to reflect an improving market,&quot; the official added.</p>
</text>
